We'll replace text field block with shared `.pathland-control` + `.pathland-input`. Add select/date/color/progress/video. Where to place? After text field block maybe. Let's construct CSS.

Need ensure `.pathland-input` retains width/flex/etc. Our shared:
```
.pathland-control,
.pathland-input {
  border-radius: var(--pl-input-radius);
  background-color: var(--pl-input-background);
  font-size: var(--pl-input-font-size);
  color: var(--pl-input-foreground);
  outline: 1px solid var(--pl-input-border);
  outline-offset: -1px;
  transition: outline-color 120ms, box-shadow 120ms;
  font-family: inherit;
  accent-color: var(--pl-control-accent);
  color-scheme: inherit;
}
.pathland-control {
  min-height: var(--pl-control-height);
  padding: var(--pl-control-padding-vertical) var(--pl-control-padding-horizontal);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.pathland-input {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.5rem;
}
```
Placeholder rules: `.pathland-input::placeholder, .pathland-control::placeholder`.
Focus: `.pathland-input:focus, .pathland-control:focus` etc.

Select:
```
.pathland-select { display: inline-block; cursor: pointer; }
.pathland-select option { background-color: var(--pl-input-background); color: var(--pl-input-foreground); }
```
Maybe `appearance:auto` default. Could set `background-image` custom arrow? Keep native arrow.
Date/color:
```
.pathland-date, .pathland-color { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
.pathland-color { padding: var(--pl-control-padding-vertical); }
.pathland-color::-webkit-color-swatch-wrapper { padding:0; }
.pathland-color::-webkit-color-swatch { border:0; border-radius: calc(var(--pl-input-radius) - 2px); }
```
`color-scheme` inherited.
Progress:
```
.pathland-progress { appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; display:block; width:100%; height:0.625rem; border:0; border-radius:9999px; overflow:hidden; background-color:var(--pl-progress-track); color:var(--pl-progress-fill); }
.pathland-progress::-webkit-progress-bar { background-color:var(--pl-progress-track); border-radius:9999px; }
